@host = http://localhost:5000
@pingHost = http://localhost:5200

### 1. GET / -> 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop -> 201 + Location, status = received
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr" }

### 4. Doc lai: received -> processing -> graded (bam nhieu lan se thay doi)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thieu du lieu (thieu repositoryUrl) -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001" }

### 6. POST bai 99 (khong ton tai) -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr" }

### 7. GET id trong -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/

### 8. Bat tay SignalR -> 200 + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub -> 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 10. Bai tap da dong nop -> 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED (them)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/2/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr" }

### 11. Bat tay hub Ping cong 5200 -> 200 (yeu cau kiem tra so 7)
POST {{pingHost}}/hubs/ping/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
